      "Section": "New Flow: Scheduled Live Events",
      "Anchor": "new-flow-scheduled-live-events",
      "SectionPath": [
        "New Flow: Scheduled Live Events"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "New Flow: Scheduled Live Events",
      "Anchor": "new-flow-scheduled-live-events",
      "SectionPath": [
        "New Flow: Scheduled Live Events"
      ],
      "Text": "To replicate the spontaneous \u0022go live now\u0022 experience, set scheduledAt to 1 minute in the future (currentTimeMs \u002B 60000).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Upload Announcement Image (Optional)",
      "Anchor": "step-1-upload-announcement-image-optional",
      "SectionPath": [
        "New Flow: Scheduled Live Events",
        "Step 1: Upload Announcement Image (Optional)"
      ],
      "Text": "If you want a custom announcement image, use POST /assets?action=registerUpload and then upload to the returned uploadUrl. Otherwise, skip this step; a placeholder image will be used.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Request",
      "Anchor": "request-4",
      "SectionPath": [
        "New Flow: Scheduled Live Events",
